            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapline 1.7.2</h2>
<p>A maintenance release with no functional changes.</p>
<p>It exists to confirm that Snapline can replace itself in place and keep
its Screen Recording permission across an update — so that future releases
arrive without interrupting you.</p>
]]></description>
